se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a library of a small town, librarian Xiao Li is arranging various books. He tells reader Xiao Liu, \"There are 80 novels here, most of them are prose, some are history books, but there are hardly any science fiction novels.\" Xiao Liu checks and finds that there are 20 history books.\n\n[Question]\nAfter checking, how many prose does Xiao Liu estimate?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After checking, Xiao Liu estimates there are 60 prose.\nB. After checking, Xiao Liu estimates there are 65 prose.\nC. After checking, Xiao Liu estimates there are 55 prose.\nD. After checking, Xiao Liu estimates there are 62 prose.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609427921000369,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e117d6006945d27fe364","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367767223,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"39d94c5dbffd4162a98bd6330501bf63"}